        "text": "15.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 359.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Complete these sentences with words from A opposite."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 460.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 If Liz doesn’t soon, she’s going to ask her doctor for a fertility test."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 492.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Karen went into at midnight and gave only four hours later."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 397.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Did Amy have a natural or a section?"
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 518.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The provides the baby growing in the mother’s with all the food it"
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 127.6,
